-- One-time data update: Sydney Marble Grand Prix gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout (Moses, 6 Nov 2026): until now it was physically the same
-- track as Lagos and Stockholm Marble Grand Prix. The Circular Quay funnel at
-- the gate, the Harbour Bridge, The Rocks, the Circular Quay S-bends, the Opera
-- House splitter (the signature), the Botanic Garden spiral, the Woolloomooloo
-- hairpin, the drop to Bondi, the Bondi wave (a half-pipe) and Macquarie
-- Street; new start shots. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its track
-- record, country records and players' personal bests start again from now
-- (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Sydney Marble Grand Prix track row changes.

